From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 07:43:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] inetcomm: RFC 2047 header encode/decode, code page info,
 MimeOleDecodeHeader/EncodeHeader

IMimeInternational::DecodeHeader (encoded words B/Q, whitespace between adjacent words dropped,
hCharset overrides the word charset, VT_LPSTR and VT_LPWSTR results, RFC1522INFO filled),
EncodeHeader (Q or B words of at most 75 characters folded with CRLF SP, always for UTF-7/8,
fRfc1522Allowed/fAllow8bit honoured, NULL info defaults), Rfc1522Decode/Encode, GetCodePageInfo
from mlang, MLANG_ConvertInetReset/ConvertInetString with a per-object conversion state. The
exports MimeOleDecodeHeader and MimeOleEncodeHeader are no longer stubs.

Per the archived Outlook Express documentation (learn.microsoft.com previous-versions oe/
oe-imimeinternational-*).

